a0a&_nc_ohc=x6QevzDU2T0Q7kNvwHtqz3Y&_nc_oc=AdmyCfpusWPg9Edjnlp1Qt-e1jLBqAjay-v_797TnmwuczAh_rf5l_opG311CGxCmaQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsxt1tJe1MQSvABcSlTGwcxZK0fBMI5FQUyz42Kug6wbw&oe=69A044FD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "EmatahnCoverHiRes.png", "id": "511241218457028", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575352_511241221790361_760251907399571310_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Te0gvI1kcoIQ7kNvwHuIKg8&_nc_oc=AdnUj72ORXjvtfzZ1aqdZSM8d4VeSI6PT6dU_ObLdofnylj4Q98GhK_P5JksegaGIDk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuSHNszrDD-wVGpNwu2HLJbxdpP1F28_Miz54FkGNkAUA&oe=69A04C92"}, "display_name": "Legend of the Ematahn", "keywords": ["Action", "Adventure", "Physics", "Combat", "Magic"], "long_description": "# Embark on a new adventure!\n\nAs you're beginning to make friends with a nearby village, a new group emerges that threatens the stability of the Highlands. Legend of the Ematahn is an action adventure game featuring physics based combat, magic, an original story, and a world waiting to be explored. Complete quests for the different factions of the Highlands. Uncover a history of conflict and defend the people against threats of all kind. Are you up to the challenge?\n\n# Features\n\n* An original story with 18 unique quests.\n* A physics based combat system with magic.\n* VR climbing and platforming quests.\n* Boss fights.\n* 5 different factions with unique characters and dialog.\n* Survival mode with 6 different maps.\n* More to be added in future updates!", "short_description": "Embark on a new adventure! Legend of the Ematahn is an action adventure game featuring physics based combat, magic, an original story, and a world waiting to be explored. Complete quests for the different factions of the Highlands. Uncover a history of conflict and defend the people against threats of all kind. Are you up to the challenge?"}]}, "developer_name": null,